abstract: >
  SolarPunk Public Lab v1.0 is an open research testbed for energy-standard
  settlement experiments: verified renewable-surplus evidence, bounded SPK
  issuance on Sepolia, network payments, and explicit launch gates. Not a
  token sale, mainnet system, or legal tender claim.
